    <p>
      <b>Algorithms</b>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>INIT copies numeric params.times and params.values into state and resets the index.</li>
      <li>OUTPUT returns 0 when data is empty; otherwise it advances to the latest time not greater than t.</li>
      <li>path is configuration metadata for loading; the native handler consumes preloaded arrays.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <b>Equation or Rule</b>
    </p>
    <latex>y = values_{index(t)}</latex>
